    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Per-PVC datasets",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 25,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 11
      },
      "description": "One row per dataset per zfs-exporter instance. Instant queries keep the instance label and group by name/type/instance so a multi-node fleet cannot merge same-named datasets; the column is named exporter because the metric exposes the exporter pod IP, not a node label. Columns come from Merge, Group by (name, type, instance), Sort by and Organize fields. namespace/claim come from kube_persistentvolumeclaim_info.volumename; the root dataset has no PV, so they stay blank. `usedbydataset` is the live data and leads the table; on thick zvols `used` is volsize + snapshots and stays flat. `snapshots` and `reservation` are the exporter's usedbysnapshots/usedbyrefreservation properties. `compression` is 1 / zfs_dataset_compression_ratio, matching `zfs get compressratio` (1.50x means logical data is 1.5 times the on-disk size). `quota`, `refquota` (filesystems) and `volsize` (zvols) are separate properties; 0 or unset/inapplicable shows as \u2014. `written` resets at each snapshot.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "zfs_dataset_used_bytes",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "",
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "zfs_dataset_used_by_dataset_bytes",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "",
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "zfs_dataset_used_by_snapshot_bytes",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "",
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "zfs_dataset_used_by_referenced_reservation_bytes",
          "instant": true,
